illion undated after year 5. Future revenue next 5y is $3.5 billion.","flags_note":"The filings describe financing for certain VMware end-users, supply-chain-finance invoices payable through a third-party financial institution, and substantial ongoing balances and transactions with VMware. They also show changes in obligation and deferred-revenue presentations, reported government-assistance benefits, later-period events, and revised prior-period values."}}